# 🎨 Task 2 – High-Fidelity UI Design

### Modern & User-Centered Interface Designed in Figma

> **CodeAlpha UI/UX Design Internship – Task 2**

---

## 📌 Project Overview

This project focuses on designing a high-fidelity user interface using Figma. The wireframes created in the previous task were transformed into a polished, visually appealing, and interactive design by applying UI/UX design principles.

The design emphasizes usability, consistency, accessibility, and responsiveness while maintaining a clean and modern aesthetic. Special attention was given to typography, color harmony, spacing, visual hierarchy, and reusable design components to create a seamless user experience.

---

## 🎯 Objectives

- Convert wireframes into high-fidelity UI designs.
- Create a visually appealing and modern interface.
- Apply responsive design principles.
- Ensure consistency using reusable components.
- Improve overall user experience and accessibility.

